# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and set in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Canonical public site origin (no trailing slash). Used for metadataBase,
# Open Graph URLs, robots.txt and sitemap.xml.
#
# - Leave UNSET on Vercel to auto-use the project's production domain.
# - Set this once you have a custom domain (e.g. https://ammarmaqsood.com).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
